### =====================================================================================
### Payer Gateway Web API - the whole prior authorization flow, in order.
### Run it in Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client). Needs: FHIR API (5100), mock EHR (5090), mock payer (5080).
### Replace the ids with the values returned by the calls above them.
### =====================================================================================
@gateway = http://localhost:5200

### 0. The payer configuration of an insurance plan id (1001 = the mock payer row in the mock EHR)
GET {{gateway}}/payers/1001

### 0b. Test the payer connection (CDS Hooks discovery)
POST {{gateway}}/payers/1001/discover

### 1. CRD: the order is signed -> read callDtr / callPas / questionnaireUrls / coverageAssertionId
POST {{gateway}}/crd/order-sign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-20260929-0001",
  "insurancePlanId": 1001,
  "patientId": "pat-1",
  "orderIds": ["ord-1-hd"],
  "orderLocationCode": "loc-main",
  "userPractitionerId": "prac-1"
}

### 2. DTR (callDtr = true): open the message link of 1 (type "smart", {{gateway}}/dtr/launch/{linkId}) in a
###    browser. The payer's SMART DTR app starts and saves its QuestionnaireResponse at the FHIR API.
### 2b. DTR: forms the SMART app saved for the order
GET {{gateway}}/dtr/saved-forms?patientId=pat-1&orderId=ord-1-hd

### 3. PAS: submit (completed DTR forms of ord-1-hd are attached automatically)
POST {{gateway}}/pas/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "PA-2026-0001",
  "insurancePlanId": 1001,
  "patientId": "pat-1",
  "requestingPractitionerId": "prac-1",
  "orderLocationCode": "loc-main",
  "orderIds": ["ord-1-hd"],
  "priority": "routine",
  "documentIds": ["doc-1-note"],
  "notes": "Patient started hemodialysis on 2026-09-01."
}

### 3b. PAS: latest stored decision
GET {{gateway}}/pas/requests/PA-2026-0001

### 3c. PAS: ask the payer now ($inquire)
POST {{gateway}}/pas/requests/PA-2026-0001/inquire

### 4a. CDex: what does the payer need? (pended requests)
GET {{gateway}}/cdex/requests/PA-2026-0001/information-requests?refresh=true

### 4b. CDex: send the additional documents
POST {{gateway}}/cdex/requests/PA-2026-0001/attachments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentIds": ["doc-1-labs"],
  "final": true
}

### 5. Cancel (optional)
POST {{gateway}}/pas/requests/PA-2026-0001/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Order cancelled by the physician." }
